# Local working data and large media that would otherwise upload on every deploy.
#
# Every pattern is anchored with a leading slash. An unanchored `evidence` also
# matches `packages/evidence`, which silently removed a source package from the
# build and broke it with a confusing module-resolution error.
/.video
/media
/evidence
/proposals
/node_modules
/contracts/out
/contracts/cache
/contracts/broadcast
/dist
/ai
